      "created_at": "2015-02-21T13:43:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Its a combination that’s not duplicated in other rounds, which gives it it’s own place. Plus hp+ir on pride or pred, is a nice dmg boost</p>\n<p>Id have like to see them increase the damage taken by +1 to the start of her next turn.</p>",
