      "id": 132883,
      "name": "DrScott",
      "username": "DrScott",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-21T13:55:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>While that partciular combo may be unique, neither of the things IR do is unique (aside from fire damage). &nbsp;Another Ammo does a better damage buff and a second Ammo changes the attack type.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I like the idea of the +1 tag for the round. &nbsp;However, in other decks with this debuff the base attack this effect is paired with is usually pretty weak, and is only applied to a single target. &nbsp;I suspect loading this variant into a submachinegun might be a bit over powered.</p>",
