      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-21T17:21:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There are certain specific circumstances where it would be desirable to use Incendiary Rounds rather than Hollow Point rounds, e.g. if your teammates include Absolute Zero, Mr. Fixer (with Pipe Wrench and Driving Mantis) or Ra/Omnitron X (if the Villain has damage redirection).</p>",
