      "created_at": "2015-02-21T18:22:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Projectile and Melee damage are typically the most common immunities.&nbsp; I don't have numbers to back it up, but it seems to be the most prominent in my experience.<br><br>Other than that?&nbsp; Yeah, it's somewhat particular in its utility and the buff is less than Hollow Points.&nbsp; Not to be too flippant, but you wouldn't be the first person with mechanical frustrations about the Rook City expansion.</p>",
